### Get one patient through the API gateway (run create-patient.http first to set patientId)
# Staff tokens may read any record. A PATIENT token may read only its own record: any other id
# is a 403, whether or not that record exists. {{accessToken}} comes from logging in via
# api-requests/gateway/.
GET http://localhost:4004/api/v1/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
